      "source": "<code>userConverters</code> - must not be null use <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Collections.html#emptyList()\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Collections.emptyList()</code></a> instead.",
      "translation": "<code>userConverters</code> - 不能为 null，请使用 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Collections.html#emptyList()\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Collections.emptyList()</code></a>。",
      "count": 3
